<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
Agarwal Uncle: Mistakes in inventory mean lost sales.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Worried">>
Agarwal Uncle: Unhappy customers, and wasted money on products that don't sell.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
