<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: But I'm systematic and detail-oriented.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I want to learn how successful businesses maintain perfect organization.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Even with hundreds of different items.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Quizzical">>
