<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: And I won't make any changes without your approval.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
Agarwal Uncle: Very well. But you start with basic counting and organizing only.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
Agarwal Uncle: No ordering decisions until you prove you understand.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Worried">>
Agarwal Uncle: How inventory affects cash flow and customer satisfaction.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Thank you for trusting me, uncle!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: I'll be the most careful and systematic assistant you've ever had.

<<jump AgarwalUncle_Day3_Continue>>
