---

<<PlayBackgroundMusic AgarewalUncle>>
<<SetBGSprite GeneralStore>>

After the selection, Raju arrives early to begin implementing his chosen approach before the rush tests his abilities.

The store welcomes Raju's early arrival. The calm provides ideal conditions for beginning without peak pressure.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
Agarwal Uncle: Ready for your first real day of retail work, beta?

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Quizzical">>
Agarwal Uncle: At present you'll discover whether your enthusiasm can handle actual demands.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Skeptical">>
Agarwal Uncle: Of serving customers and managing business operations.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: I'm completely ready, uncle!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I've been thinking about this opportunity all night.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: I'm eager to prove that my help can make a genuine difference.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
Agarwal Uncle: We'll see how you handle the pressure.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Skeptical">>
Agarwal Uncle: When customers want fast service and perfect accuracy simultaneously.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
Agarwal Uncle: Retail work tests both your skills and your character under stress.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: I understand, uncle.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: But I believe that helping your business succeed will teach me valuable lessons.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: About precision, customer relations, and the importance of small enterprises.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Smiling">>
Agarwal Uncle: Your attitude is promising, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
Agarwal Uncle: Now let's see if your performance matches your commitment.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
Agarwal Uncle: The rush starts in two hours.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Then let's use these two hours to prepare perfectly!

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Smiling">>
Agarwal Uncle: Good thinking. Come, let me show you the critical details.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
Agarwal Uncle: The ones that separate adequate service from excellent service.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I'm ready to learn everything, uncle!

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Smiling">>
Agarwal Uncle: Your enthusiasm is refreshing, beta. Let's put it to work.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
Agarwal Uncle: Remember - accuracy first, then speed. Never the other way around.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Accuracy first, then speed. Got it, uncle.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Smiling">>
Agarwal Uncle: You're learning already. Now let's begin.

<<HideAllCharacters>>

As preparation intensifies, both understand the next few hours will provide definitive evidence of whether his assistance represents genuine value.

